Files from other projects
-------------------------

refs/urdf/
    URDF, MJCF and STL mesh files of the SO-101 arm, taken from
    https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100 (folder Simulation/SO101, commit
    a758567c3978dfeefe282ede0500085a48fe8f78 of 2026-10-06), which is licensed under the
    Apache License, Version 2.0. README.md in that folder is the upstream README.
    refs/urdf/history/ holds four versions of so101_new_calib.urdf from the history of the same
    repository (the short commit id is in each file name; 385e8d7 is the current one).
    Not copied: so101_leader_new_calib.urdf, so101_new_calib_camera.xml and the two camera meshes
    that so101_new_calib_camera.urdf refers to (wrist_camera_mount_so101_v1.stl,
    wrist_camera_so101_v1.stl), so that file cannot be loaded with its meshes from here.
    The tests use so101_new_calib.urdf and the meshes as an independent reference for the kinematics
    and the gripper shape; the other files are kept for reference.
    Numbers taken from them (joint origins, link masses and centres of mass, gripper geometry) are
    also in kinematics.py, phys_bus.py, gripper_model.py, refs/gripper/so101_gripper_model.py and
    test_kinematics.py.
